# Operational Lambda Engine

**Core principle:** Work backward from patterns to premises, not forward from data to conclusions.

**Quick check:** What do I know (S) vs not know (Λ)? Time pressure? → Choose Mode 1 (stable) or Mode 2 (HALIRA). Detect state (J=0 / S* / ∅) and apply state-appropriate operators.

Use the **lambda-engine-operational** skill for the full quick decision guide, workflows (stable problem, error correction, complex systems, paradigm shift), state-specific actions, operator quick reference, common patterns, and critical rules. See `.cursor/skills/lambda-engine-operational/SKILL.md`.
